# Project map (Godot 4.x)

**Planning:** [`docs/PLANNING.md`](docs/PLANNING.md) · [`docs/CURSOR.md`](docs/CURSOR.md) · [`docs/SHIP_PLAN.md`](docs/SHIP_PLAN.md) · [`docs/LIVE_PATHS.md`](docs/LIVE_PATHS.md) · [`scripts/README.md`](scripts/README.md)

## Every session

1. **Gate** — `.\scripts\run_all_combat_checks.ps1` → **`PHASE0: PASS`** (do not pipe harness to `grep`)
2. **Campaign ship** — [`SHIP_PLAN#pre-start-checklist`](docs/SHIP_PLAN.md#pre-start-checklist): Camp-1.1 first; product choices at [`decision-gates`](docs/SHIP_PLAN.md#decision-gates-at-implementation) only (`CompanyState` [§19 stubs](docs/SHIP_PLAN.md#implementation-stubs))
3. **Parallel OK (default):** Campaign + Combat — [`PLANNING#parallel-agents`](docs/PLANNING.md#parallel-agents); merge when both PASS
4. **Single agent:** one `Camp-*` **or** one Combat fix

| Stream | Use for | Paths |
|--------|---------|-------|
| **Campaign** | `Camp-*` in SHIP_PLAN | `world/*`, `main.gd`, `PartyMenu`, new economy UI |
| **Combat** | LIVE_PATHS maintain | `combat/*`, harness, `BattleUIUpdater` — not `world/*` |
| **Playtest** | F5 feel | `run_q_feel.ps1` / `run_q_audit.ps1` |
| **Expand** | IV-\* | frozen until Camp-5; not parallel with Campaign+Combat |

**Shared (one agent at a time):** `CampaignEncounterBridge.gd`, `CombatFlow.gd` → Campaign leads; `CoreEntity` / bleed constants → Combat only.

## Combat code (Combat stream)

- `combat/CombatManager.gd` — thin orchestrator; `CombatFormationSetup` seeds; `get_health_entity` → `CombatantEntityAccess`; formation → `ZoneOfControl.formation_dict_for_zone_geometry`. **D-008:** no crash/intrusion; **`attempt_close`** live.
- Extend smallest `combat/*.gd` per LIVE_PATHS. Harness: `CombatRegressionHarness.gd` + tails.

## Campaign code (Campaign stream)

- `main.gd` · `world/CampaignEncounterBridge.gd` · `EncounterNode.gd` · `CombatFlow.gd` · `PartyMemberSnapshot.gd` · `ui/PartyMenu.gd`
- `world/CompanyState.gd` (§19 stubs until gates close) · `SettlementPanel` · Camp rows per SHIP_PLAN — not new combat tiers.

## Do not unless asked

- New `FEATURE_*` · bleed retune · BMI (**F1**) · closed S1–S11/P3b · research `note` rows · IV-1,3,5–13 · legacy labels ~~S/M/Q/F3~~ · tombstone `docs/*.md` in LIVE_PATHS#redirects-tombstones
